      "narration": "Open the config and there are six lines. Six. And one of them, set to false, is the entire isolation — it tells Python to look only in this folder and never at the machine.",
      "data": {
        "uvStage": {
          "layout": "terminal",
          "color": "blue",
          "headline": "Six lines, [that is all]",
